BT
/F2 18 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 726 Tm (Contoso Air Service Bulletin SB-HP24S-07) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 704 Tm (Applies to: HP-24S outdoor units manufactured 2021-01 through 2022-12) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 682 Tm (Subject: Outdoor fan motor bearing wear) Tj
/F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 648 Tm (Symptom) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 626 Tm (A grinding or rasping noise from the outdoor unit that rises and falls with fan speed,) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 604 Tm (often loudest after a defrost cycle. Fault code D07 may also be logged.) Tj
/F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 570 Tm (Cause) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 548 Tm (Early bearing wear on the 1/4 HP fan motor. The motor windings are normally unaffected.) Tj
/F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 514 Tm (Action) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 492 Tm (1. Isolate power and check the fan shaft for radial play.) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 470 Tm (2. Play under 0.5 mm: replace the bearings with kit BRG-KIT-1.) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 448 Tm (3. Play over 0.5 mm or a scored shaft: replace the motor \(FAN-HP24\).) Tj
/F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 414 Tm (Warranty) Tj
/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 60 392 Tm (Covered under the standard parts and labor warranty. Quote this bulletin on the claim.) Tj
ET
